r←testArrowFromRuntime;req;r;db;con;err;msg;out_conv;out_chunk
⎕CS ##
⍝ Runtime null-smoke tests for inbound Arrow conversion APIs.
⍝ Avoids Arrow struct marshalling by using null pointers.

:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf

req←{0::⍺,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message ⋄ ⍵:⍺,' - OK' ⋄ ⍺,' - FAILED'}
r←⊂'Test Arrow From APIs (runtime null-smoke)'

db←open ':memory:'
con←connect db

⍝ schema_from_arrow(null-schema)
out_conv←0
err←schemaFromArrow con 0 out_conv
r,←⊂'schemaFromArrow(null) returned error_data handle' req err≠0
:If err≠0
    r,←⊂'schemaFromArrow(null) has error flag' req 1=api.duckdb_error_data_has_error err
    msg←512 read.utf8 api.duckdb_error_data_message err
    r,←⊂'schemaFromArrow(null) error message available' req 0<≢msg
    {}api.duckdb_destroy_error_data ⊂err
:EndIf

⍝ data_chunk_from_arrow(null-array/null-schema)
out_chunk←0
err←dataChunkFromArrow con 0 0 out_chunk
r,←⊂'dataChunkFromArrow(null) returned error_data handle' req err≠0
:If err≠0
    r,←⊂'dataChunkFromArrow(null) has error flag' req 1=api.duckdb_error_data_has_error err
    msg←512 read.utf8 api.duckdb_error_data_message err
    r,←⊂'dataChunkFromArrow(null) error message available' req 0<≢msg
    {}api.duckdb_destroy_error_data ⊂err
:EndIf

{}disconnect con
{}close db

r,←⊂''
r,←⊂'Arrow from runtime null-smoke complete!'
⎕←↑r

